<title>NETHERLANDS: Schuitema Q1 net rises seven percent.</title>
<headline>Schuitema Q1 net rises seven percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    11.7  vs  10.9</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.00 vs  941 million</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    14.0  vs  13.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Grocery wholesaler Schuitema NV, 73 percent</p>
<p>owned by Ahold NV, said it expected 1997</p>
<p>earnings per share would show a &quot;clear&quot; increase over 1996.</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.5  vs  same</p>
<p>    Interest income			2.2  vs   2.7</p>
<p>    Tax					6.5  vs   6.0</p>
<p>    Third party income		   2.5  vs   1.1</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
